WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 27=

5
01:39.340 --> 01:40.780
(Taiji Palace) His Majesty summons

6
01:41.860 --> 01:44.580
Meng Zaishi, Military Governor of the Central Circuit,

7
01:44.900 --> 01:47.260
Lu Yan, General of the Left Jinwu Guard,

8
01:47.700 --> 01:49.540
and Wei Shu of the Censorate!

9
01:50.180 --> 01:51.060
Meng Zaishi,

10
01:51.420 --> 01:53.580
you are hereby appointed Military Governor of North Jing,

11
01:54.020 --> 01:55.660
with authority over the Eastern, Western, and Central Circuits.

12
01:56.060 --> 01:57.140
Receive the decree and give thanks.

13
01:58.340 --> 01:58.740
I

14
01:59.340 --> 02:00.260
gratefully accept, Your Majesty.

15
02:09.220 --> 02:09.660
Your Majesty,

16
02:10.500 --> 02:12.100
I request permission to depart.

17
02:13.300 --> 02:13.860
No rush.

18
02:15.020 --> 02:17.100
General, you may delay your departure.

19
02:19.580 --> 02:22.060
General Lu Yan has rendered great service in quelling the rebellion.

20
02:22.380 --> 02:24.100
You were granted the title of Marquis of Zhongshan.

21
02:24.900 --> 02:26.100
Your rank and stipend shall be increased,

22
02:26.300 --> 02:27.300
and your descendants

23
02:27.780 --> 02:29.580
shall inherit your title for generations to come.

24
02:33.660 --> 02:35.860
Thank you for your generosity, Your Majesty!

25
02:43.220 --> 02:43.980
General Lu...

26
02:44.820 --> 02:45.100
No,

27
02:46.020 --> 02:47.140
Marquis of Zhongshan.

28
02:48.020 --> 02:50.860
You needn't toil in the army anymore.

29
02:51.420 --> 02:54.100
You can enjoy a life of wealth and leisure.

30
02:58.460 --> 02:59.500
Your Majesty, what does this mean?

31
03:00.460 --> 03:02.940
You personally captured Yu Cheng'an.

32
03:03.060 --> 03:04.060
Yours was the greatest contribution,

33
03:04.660 --> 03:06.060
surpassing everyone else's.

34
03:06.660 --> 03:09.020
I am grateful to Heaven

35
03:09.580 --> 03:11.180
for giving Huai a new lease on life.

36
03:11.820 --> 03:12.300
Therefore,

37
03:13.020 --> 03:14.260
I shall grant a general amnesty

38
03:14.620 --> 03:16.340
and host a month of palace banquets.

39
03:17.300 --> 03:19.260
Besides, the weather is cold and the roads are slippery.

40
03:19.820 --> 03:21.500
Why not stay at the palace

41
03:21.540 --> 03:22.780
and rest a few more days, General?

42
03:23.140 --> 03:23.940
Once the celebrations are over,

43
03:24.300 --> 03:25.420
you may depart.

44
03:28.180 --> 03:28.700
Your Majesty,

45
03:29.620 --> 03:30.620
your imperial wine is exquisite,

46
03:31.340 --> 03:32.420
and I'd gladly stay to enjoy it.

47
03:32.900 --> 03:33.900
But if I delay my return,

48
03:34.260 --> 03:35.660
I fear unrest may break out in North Jing.

49
03:38.180 --> 03:39.340
You worry too much, General.

50
03:40.500 --> 03:42.500
I'll send an envoy to North Jing

51
03:42.780 --> 03:44.540
to reassure your troops.

52
03:45.180 --> 03:46.180
Your Majesty may not realize,

53
03:46.700 --> 03:48.220
but the men of North Jing are a rough lot.

54
03:49.140 --> 03:50.420
I fear any envoy you send

55
03:51.460 --> 03:52.860
may not make it back alive.

56
03:58.980 --> 04:02.100
Mu Xianqing's death has already been announced throughout the empire.

57
04:03.140 --> 04:05.140
If something were to happen to you too, General,

58
04:05.860 --> 04:06.980
I fear North Jing

59
04:07.580 --> 04:09.340
would descend into chaos again,

60
04:09.340 --> 04:10.780
just as it did when your uncle died.

61
04:11.380 --> 04:12.700
Another upheaval could follow.

62
04:26.580 --> 04:27.860
Your Majesty makes a good point.

63
04:30.140 --> 04:31.580
I'll issue written orders to my deputy.

64
04:32.380 --> 04:33.660
- Tell him... - Tell him...

65
04:35.860 --> 04:37.180
"All is well,

66
04:37.900 --> 04:39.060
and I'll return shortly."

67
04:41.180 --> 04:43.020
Then which envoy will Your Majesty send

68
04:44.780 --> 04:46.100
to die in North Jing?

69
04:47.300 --> 04:54.200
(Liangyi Hall; Universe in Harmony)

70
05:03.140 --> 05:04.180
North Jing is a harsh, bitterly cold place.

71
05:04.660 --> 05:05.620
Take good care of yourself

72
05:06.020 --> 05:07.340
on your journey.

73
05:10.660 --> 05:11.540
Thank you for your concern.

74
05:13.980 --> 05:14.740
Your Majesty,

75
05:15.260 --> 05:16.580
in this round of rewards,

76
05:17.100 --> 05:18.780
haven't you overlooked someone?

77
05:37.460 --> 05:37.940
Your Highness.

78
05:47.340 --> 05:48.780
Once the hunt is over, the bow is cast aside.

79
05:49.980 --> 05:50.900
Just as I expected.

80
05:51.940 --> 05:52.900
But why hasn't His Majesty

81
05:54.500 --> 05:55.700
come after

82
05:55.700 --> 05:56.940
Yang Si and me yet?

83
05:57.620 --> 05:58.700
Yang Si aside,

84
06:00.300 --> 06:01.940
you are His Majesty's son, after all.

85
06:02.820 --> 06:04.820
Yu Cheng'an's downfall is already a tremendous blessing.

86
06:05.740 --> 06:06.780
Now that the rewards have been granted,

87
06:07.500 --> 06:08.580
you can finally put your mind at ease.

88
06:09.260 --> 06:10.180
Son...

89
06:15.140 --> 06:16.020
(Virtue, Diligence, Joy, and Peace) Let me hold the baby!

90
06:17.180 --> 06:17.700
Careful, careful.

91
06:18.140 --> 06:18.860
Easy.

92
06:43.580 --> 06:44.660
Cailian did your hair, didn't she?

93
06:47.660 --> 06:48.140
That girl...

94
06:49.820 --> 06:51.540
Your Highness, let me redo it for you.

95
06:56.220 --> 06:56.740
Chunhua,

96
06:59.020 --> 06:59.660
tell me,

97
07:00.340 --> 07:01.340
what would you do

98
07:02.420 --> 07:03.820
if you suddenly discovered that someone closest to you

99
07:04.740 --> 07:05.620
had become unrecognizable,

100
07:07.460 --> 07:09.220
nothing like the person

101
07:10.700 --> 07:11.500
you thought you knew?

102
07:18.420 --> 07:19.180
Greetings, Your Highness.

103
07:22.340 --> 07:23.820
Well, Wanyao...

104
07:24.340 --> 07:25.060
Could you...

105
07:25.820 --> 07:27.220
step out for now?

106
07:28.660 --> 07:29.580
I just got here,

107
07:30.220 --> 07:30.860
and you're already kicking me out?

108
07:32.660 --> 07:33.220
No, it's just...

109
07:33.900 --> 07:35.980
Your personal guard has been looking everywhere for you.

110
07:35.980 --> 07:37.540
He seemed pretty anxious.

111
07:38.740 --> 07:42.180
(Myriad Blessings Gather)

112
07:42.780 --> 07:43.300
Your Highness,

113
07:43.980 --> 07:45.260
the Crown Prince just sent word.

114
07:45.500 --> 07:46.460
Meng Zaishi couldn't leave the capital.

115
07:46.740 --> 07:47.620
He was summoned back to the palace.

116
07:47.940 --> 07:49.660
Lu Yan has been made a marquis and removed from the Jinwu Guard.

117
07:50.020 --> 07:50.460
And

118
07:50.660 --> 07:52.500
Wei Shu and Yan Shang were summoned, too.

119
07:58.300 --> 07:59.020
Take me to the palace, quickly!

120
08:04.780 --> 08:06.180
If I remember correctly,

121
08:06.340 --> 08:07.620
we've met twice before.

122
08:08.500 --> 08:09.860
Yet your name

123
08:11.180 --> 08:13.300
keeps coming up in conversations around me.

124
08:14.300 --> 08:15.660
And every time it does,

125
08:15.780 --> 08:17.940
it leaves quite an impression.

126
08:18.700 --> 08:19.460
I'm humbled, Your Majesty.

127
08:21.940 --> 08:22.460
Rise.

128
08:23.380 --> 08:24.060
Thank you, Your Majesty.

129
08:26.620 --> 08:28.620
There was even a rumor that Wanyao

130
08:29.100 --> 08:31.740
brought a handsome young man all the way back from Lingnan.

131
08:32.460 --> 08:33.460
That was you too, wasn't it?

132
08:34.820 --> 08:35.420
Yes, Your Majesty.

133
08:36.500 --> 08:37.140
It was me.

134
08:37.540 --> 08:39.340
I once personally chose you to marry her.

135
08:39.540 --> 08:41.340
You agreed without hesitation.

136
08:42.180 --> 08:43.420
But at the time,

137
08:43.860 --> 08:48.020
that traitor Yu was still determined to send her to North Jing.

138
08:48.540 --> 08:51.660
Becoming her husband would've been like stepping into a furnace.

139
08:52.380 --> 08:54.380
You're a clever man. Surely you knew that.

140
08:58.540 --> 08:59.700
When I look upon Princess Danyang,

141
09:00.540 --> 09:01.740
it's like gazing up at the radiant moon.

142
09:02.500 --> 09:04.020
I saw no burning coals or blazing furnace.

143
09:04.900 --> 09:06.340
I was simply overwhelmed by the honor.

144
09:10.140 --> 09:11.820
And when she shot Zheng Xing dead,

145
09:11.860 --> 09:13.020
you took the blame for her,

146
09:13.820 --> 09:15.700
were you overwhelmed by that honor too?

147
09:21.260 --> 09:21.580
Yes.

148
09:23.220 --> 09:24.060
I did so

149
09:25.060 --> 09:26.500
to repay the Princess for recognizing my worth.

150
09:27.900 --> 09:30.020
You keep saying how honored you are,

151
09:30.700 --> 09:32.260
how grateful you are for her recognition.

152
09:33.620 --> 09:34.420
Then tell me,

153
09:36.100 --> 09:37.420
in the incident at the hunting grounds,

154
09:38.140 --> 09:40.100
what exactly was your role?

155
09:45.820 --> 09:47.340
- I... - Don't try telling me

156
09:47.340 --> 09:49.580
it was all the Crown Prince and Princess's doing.

157
09:50.180 --> 09:52.420
I've carefully examined what happened that night.

158
09:54.380 --> 09:55.900
You were deeply involved,

159
09:56.180 --> 09:56.580
weren't you?

160
10:01.380 --> 10:03.180
Quite impressive for a farmer from Lingnan.

161
10:05.660 --> 10:06.420
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

162
10:09.060 --> 10:11.340
You played a major role in bringing down Yu's faction.

163
10:11.940 --> 10:12.740
What have you done wrong?

164
10:13.140 --> 10:13.580
Your Majesty,

165
10:15.420 --> 10:17.780
when I was a farmer in Lingnan,

166
10:18.620 --> 10:19.860
I was fortunate enough to glimpse the splendor of the court.

167
10:20.620 --> 10:21.940
I begged the Princess to give me a chance,

168
10:22.260 --> 10:23.740
so I could come to Sheng'an for the imperial examinations.

169
10:24.780 --> 10:25.700
As a scholar,

170
10:26.180 --> 10:27.460
all I wanted was to enter public service

171
10:27.980 --> 10:28.980
and put my education to good use.

172
10:29.980 --> 10:31.540
But I knew my abilities were modest.

173
10:32.300 --> 10:34.100
To earn Your Majesty's and the Princess's favor,

174
10:35.020 --> 10:36.140
I had to follow Mao Sui's example

175
10:37.060 --> 10:38.260
and do everything I could

176
10:38.660 --> 10:39.740
to show off my talents at every opportunity.

177
10:40.980 --> 10:41.700
To claim I had no desire

178
10:42.380 --> 10:44.380
for fame, fortune, glory, or recognition

179
10:45.380 --> 10:46.180
would be lying to Your Majesty.

180
10:47.180 --> 10:47.580
Therefore,

181
10:48.500 --> 10:48.860
I

182
10:49.460 --> 10:49.980
admit my fault.

183
10:51.700 --> 10:52.580
Yan Shang,

184
10:52.740 --> 10:54.140
you keep asking

185
10:55.340 --> 10:56.740
for my forgiveness,

186
10:56.740 --> 10:57.700
but in truth,

187
10:58.100 --> 11:00.820
you're avoiding the real question.

188
11:02.940 --> 11:03.900
Come closer and answer me.

189
11:05.460 --> 11:05.820
Yes, Your Majesty.

190
11:13.060 --> 11:14.100
You know, Wanyao

191
11:14.900 --> 11:16.740
is the only child of my first wife.

192
11:17.340 --> 11:19.180
She's also the daughter I cherish most.

193
11:19.780 --> 11:22.020
She's clever and strong-willed.

194
11:22.540 --> 11:23.100
Of course,

195
11:23.700 --> 11:26.500
she can be willful and spoiled at times.

196
11:27.660 --> 11:28.420
But after

197
11:29.700 --> 11:31.460
she survived that monster Meng Baiyu

198
11:31.460 --> 11:32.420
and came home alive,

199
11:33.020 --> 11:35.580
then smiled so sweetly in Yu Cheng'an's presence,

200
11:36.140 --> 11:38.540
I realized my daughter

201
11:39.340 --> 11:40.340
knows how to endure

202
11:42.300 --> 11:43.500
and hide her true intentions.

203
11:51.980 --> 11:54.300
Whether it was Yu Cheng'an or Wei Qiao,

204
11:54.660 --> 11:56.740
they lost to Wanyao

205
11:56.740 --> 11:58.220
for one simple reason.

206
11:58.220 --> 11:58.900
They thought

207
11:59.220 --> 12:01.300
she was just like Luling,

208
12:02.060 --> 12:04.740
interested in nothing but pleasure and amusement.

209
12:05.460 --> 12:06.100
After all,

210
12:07.100 --> 12:08.540
what can

211
12:09.180 --> 12:10.140
a woman possibly do?

212
12:10.500 --> 12:12.580
Keep a few cats and dogs

213
12:12.580 --> 12:14.460
as pets to amuse herself.

214
12:15.460 --> 12:16.260
Maybe accidentally

215
12:17.060 --> 12:19.860
crush a butterfly or dragonfly.

216
12:20.260 --> 12:21.620
That's about the worst she could do.

217
12:22.300 --> 12:25.540
Back then, Luling had Yu Cheng'an's support.

218
12:25.660 --> 12:26.980
How powerful she seemed.

219
12:27.980 --> 12:29.180
But that was all she amounted to.

220
12:31.860 --> 12:32.300
Your Majesty,

221
12:34.260 --> 12:35.740
Princess Danyang is kindhearted.

222
12:37.180 --> 12:38.940
She would never commit such cruel acts.

223
12:40.980 --> 12:43.260
You seem to know my daughter better than I do.

224
12:48.180 --> 12:49.820
A young widow,

225
12:50.340 --> 12:52.380
with no leverage or powerful allies,

226
12:52.580 --> 12:54.180
managed, in so little time,

227
12:54.580 --> 12:56.180
to form an alliance with her half-brother,

228
12:56.980 --> 12:59.300
gather devoted admirers and wait for her chance,

229
12:59.580 --> 13:00.660
turn the tables,

230
13:01.340 --> 13:03.660
and bring Yu Cheng'an down overnight.

231
13:07.180 --> 13:09.700
Luling was so arrogant back then.

232
13:10.220 --> 13:13.140
Yet all she did was secure a few official titles

233
13:13.620 --> 13:14.940
for her male favorites,

234
13:15.740 --> 13:17.740
filling the court with a few more fools.

235
13:19.460 --> 13:21.380
But when it comes to stirring up trouble

236
13:22.380 --> 13:24.620
and turning the entire court

237
13:25.260 --> 13:26.900
upside down,

238
13:27.740 --> 13:29.420
she's no match for Wanyao.

239
13:35.020 --> 13:35.540
What a shame.

240
13:40.900 --> 13:41.300
Your Majesty,

241
13:42.380 --> 13:43.500
Princess Danyang is sincere and devoted to you.

242
13:44.260 --> 13:45.060
She kept a low profile for years,

243
13:45.340 --> 13:46.780
all to help you eliminate Yu's faction.

244
13:47.380 --> 13:48.380
She even risked her own life.

245
13:49.660 --> 13:50.580
Her intentions are clear,

246
13:51.100 --> 13:52.060
and her sacrifices deserve compassion.

247
13:57.580 --> 13:58.700
Are you worried

248
13:59.020 --> 14:02.100
I'll treat her the way I treated Meng Zaishi and Lu Yan?

249
14:11.980 --> 14:12.380
Your Majesty,

250
14:16.180 --> 14:16.740
the Princess

251
14:18.860 --> 14:19.900
is merely a woman.

252
14:21.820 --> 14:22.620
She cannot govern a fief

253
14:23.380 --> 14:24.060
or command an army.

254
14:24.940 --> 14:25.700
She could never pose a threat to...

255
14:26.180 --> 14:26.540
Enough!

256
14:29.900 --> 14:31.100
Yu Cheng'an's mistake,

257
14:31.700 --> 14:32.020
I

258
14:32.940 --> 14:33.900
will not repeat it.

259
14:48.620 --> 14:49.300
Yan Shang,

260
14:49.740 --> 14:51.060
have you ever kept a parrot?

261
14:52.700 --> 14:53.260
Your Majesty,

262
14:54.060 --> 14:54.460
I have not.

263
14:55.620 --> 14:57.100
When you keep a parrot,

264
14:57.420 --> 15:00.300
you must regularly clip its wings.

265
15:02.780 --> 15:05.860
As a boy, I kept a white parrot.

266
15:07.220 --> 15:09.660
We spent every day together.

267
15:10.140 --> 15:12.420
It would even fall asleep in the palm of my hand.

268
15:13.180 --> 15:15.660
I taught it every word it knew.

269
15:17.420 --> 15:18.660
But it was my own fault.

270
15:18.980 --> 15:20.500
I couldn't bring myself to clip its wings.

271
15:21.700 --> 15:22.860
Until one day,

272
15:23.380 --> 15:24.700
it escaped its cage and flew away.

273
15:25.820 --> 15:27.540
No matter how often I called, it wouldn't return.

274
15:29.380 --> 15:30.540
In a fit of rage,

275
15:33.260 --> 15:34.220
I shot it down

276
15:35.420 --> 15:36.580
with my own hands.

277
15:40.860 --> 15:41.300
What a pity.

278
15:43.580 --> 15:44.900
That bird could've

279
15:45.460 --> 15:46.660
lived a very long life.

280
15:47.500 --> 15:48.420
If only

281
15:49.500 --> 15:50.580
it hadn't had those wings.

282
15:51.780 --> 15:52.660
Otherwise,

283
15:53.700 --> 15:55.460
perhaps it would still be here with me today.

284
15:59.180 --> 16:00.380
And you, Yan Shang,

285
16:01.780 --> 16:02.940
are Wanyao's

286
16:04.100 --> 16:05.100
pair of wings.

287
16:10.100 --> 16:10.860
Bring it here.

288
16:32.820 --> 16:33.340
Princess Danyang!

289
16:38.020 --> 16:38.700
I demand to see His Majesty!

290
16:39.220 --> 16:39.780
You can't, Your Highness.

291
16:40.100 --> 16:41.260
You must be announced first.

292
16:44.060 --> 16:44.820
On the night of the hunt,

293
16:45.900 --> 16:46.900
if we'd run into you,

294
16:47.700 --> 16:48.900
disaster would've struck!

295
16:49.180 --> 16:49.980
Since the traitor Yu's downfall,

296
16:50.540 --> 16:51.380
His Majesty has repeatedly ordered us

297
16:51.660 --> 16:52.340
to tighten security.

298
16:57.060 --> 16:57.420
Your Highness,

299
16:58.060 --> 16:58.460
please...

300
16:59.500 --> 17:00.100
Don't.

301
17:14.020 --> 17:15.860
Though I'm grateful for the Princess's support,

302
17:16.740 --> 17:18.460
I owe my position to Your Majesty.

303
17:19.420 --> 17:20.900
Naturally, I serve at your command.

304
17:21.580 --> 17:22.660
Everything I do and think

305
17:23.420 --> 17:24.420
is for Your Majesty's benefit.

306
17:25.540 --> 17:26.020
You say

307
17:26.860 --> 17:28.060
I'm the Princess's wings.

308
17:29.140 --> 17:30.180
I wouldn't dare claim such importance.

309
17:31.700 --> 17:33.020
But I can see

310
17:33.700 --> 17:35.980
you'd risk your life for her,

311
17:36.300 --> 17:38.060
and she's deeply in love with you.

312
17:39.260 --> 17:40.100
I'm afraid

313
17:40.900 --> 17:42.260
your entanglement

314
17:43.580 --> 17:44.740
has blurred the line between duty and love.

315
17:48.020 --> 17:49.020
I wouldn't lie to Your Majesty.

316
17:50.380 --> 17:51.140
I have indeed

317
17:51.900 --> 17:52.380
secretly

318
17:53.260 --> 17:54.500
fallen in love with the Princess.

319
17:56.140 --> 17:56.460
But

320
17:57.900 --> 17:58.700
she has

321
18:00.620 --> 18:02.100
rejected me herself, many times.

322
18:07.380 --> 18:08.060
I beg Your Majesty

323
18:09.420 --> 18:10.300
to forgive my recklessness

324
18:10.860 --> 18:11.340
and my

325
18:13.060 --> 18:14.060
foolish hopes.

326
18:24.020 --> 18:25.100
If Your Majesty would show me mercy,

327
18:26.260 --> 18:26.820
please allow me

328
18:28.580 --> 18:29.700
to resign and return home.

329
18:36.300 --> 18:37.660
I'll never set foot in Sheng'an again.

330
18:39.340 --> 18:39.940
Nor will I...

331
18:51.340 --> 18:53.380
Nor will I ever go near the Princess again.

332
19:09.380 --> 19:10.220
Yan Shang,

333
19:10.980 --> 19:14.300
did you know that while you were detained at the Investigation Office,

334
19:15.660 --> 19:18.100
Wanyao was pleading for your life?

335
19:18.900 --> 19:21.420
She knelt before me, crying and begging

336
19:21.980 --> 19:23.580
for a special pardon for you.

337
19:24.260 --> 19:25.340
Since our dynasty was founded,

338
19:25.740 --> 19:26.740
only three people

339
19:27.340 --> 19:28.700
have ever received such a pardon.

340
19:30.620 --> 19:31.220
I didn't know.

341
19:31.700 --> 19:32.300
So you see,

342
19:33.900 --> 19:36.300
as far as I'm concerned, you two

343
19:37.220 --> 19:38.860
are clearly in love with each other.

344
19:39.260 --> 19:40.380
You'd entrust each other with your lives.

345
19:42.380 --> 19:45.140
It's because she had your help

346
19:45.540 --> 19:46.860
that she killed Zheng Xing,

347
19:47.100 --> 19:49.100
defied Meng Zaishi, and defeated Yu Cheng'an.

348
19:50.260 --> 19:51.660
What couldn't she accomplish with you by her side?

349
20:01.860 --> 20:02.300
Your Majesty,

350
20:03.500 --> 20:03.940
I...

351
20:05.540 --> 20:07.300
I'm merely a commoner from the countryside.

352
20:08.220 --> 20:09.180
But didn't you just

353
20:09.940 --> 20:11.180
compare yourself to Mao Sui?

354
20:12.020 --> 20:14.580
You know, Mao Sui's eloquence

355
20:14.700 --> 20:16.860
was mightier than an army of a million men.

356
20:26.900 --> 20:27.580
But Your Majesty,

357
20:28.620 --> 20:29.300
your daughter

358
20:29.940 --> 20:31.900
is nothing like the Crown Prince or Meng Zaishi.

359
20:32.980 --> 20:34.580
If they commanded an army of a million,

360
20:35.020 --> 20:36.700
they'd seek absolute power.

361
20:37.620 --> 20:38.260
But Wanyao...

362
20:39.540 --> 20:40.300
All she wants

363
20:41.860 --> 20:42.700
is freedom.

364
20:48.380 --> 20:50.540
A bird whose wings haven't been clipped

365
20:51.420 --> 20:52.900
must be kept in a cage.

366
20:54.220 --> 20:54.620
Yan Shang,

367
20:55.180 --> 20:56.660
it's precisely because of you

368
20:57.060 --> 20:57.620
that Wanyao

369
20:59.340 --> 21:00.540
is even farther

370
21:00.980 --> 21:02.100
from her freedom.

371
21:04.140 --> 21:04.780
Now tell me,

372
21:06.300 --> 21:07.380
that day at the hunting grounds,

373
21:07.700 --> 21:09.260
when the two armies faced off,

374
21:09.620 --> 21:10.700
I seem to recall

375
21:10.940 --> 21:13.300
you were the first to say I wasn't there.

376
21:13.700 --> 21:14.060
Am I right?

377
21:15.940 --> 21:17.260
The Princess issued a false decree.

378
21:18.060 --> 21:19.660
Was that her own idea,

379
21:20.940 --> 21:23.260
or did you put her up to it?

380
22:15.220 --> 22:15.980
- Your Highness! - Your Highness!

381
22:16.100 --> 22:16.660
Get out of my way!

382
22:23.260 --> 22:24.060
Yan Shang...

383
22:28.100 --> 22:29.460
I've doomed you.

384
22:32.540 --> 22:33.060
I...

385
22:55.100 --> 23:00.020
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

386
23:02.180 --> 23:07.540
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

387
23:09.620 --> 23:15.740
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

388
23:15.820 --> 23:21.580
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

389
23:23.940 --> 23:29.260
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

390
23:29.300 --> 23:36.060
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - Let grief drown in your eyes♪

391
23:37.500 --> 23:40.520
♪- Soar with the wind; - Plunge into hellfire as one♪

392
23:40.520 --> 23:42.340
♪Burning bright as a song♪

393
23:42.820 --> 23:44.020
Yan Shang, receive the imperial decree.

394
23:44.460 --> 23:45.420
By His Majesty's personal decree:

395
23:46.020 --> 23:47.620
Yan Shang, Collator at Hongwen Hall,

396
23:48.140 --> 23:50.300
is well versed in the classics, and skilled in practical affairs.

397
23:50.540 --> 23:51.580
I commend him highly.

398
23:52.180 --> 23:52.980
In recognition of his service,

399
23:53.180 --> 23:54.460
I hereby grant him three months' leave

400
23:54.660 --> 23:56.060
to return home and visit his family,

401
23:56.220 --> 23:57.460
as a mark of imperial favor.

402
23:57.820 --> 23:58.940
By imperial command!

403
23:59.900 --> 24:00.620
I, Yan Shang,

404
24:01.140 --> 24:02.060
gratefully accept Your Majesty's decree.

405
24:02.060 --> 24:05.820
♪I'll wait if you're there♪

406
24:05.820 --> 24:09.260
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

407
24:09.380 --> 24:12.940
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

408
24:12.980 --> 24:19.820
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world, let's return to when we first met♪

409
24:20.060 --> 24:21.940
♪- May time be free of fear; - Boats rock♪

410
24:21.940 --> 24:24.580
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn; - May time be free of pain♪

411
24:24.660 --> 24:27.180
♪You're the only one I need♪

412
24:27.220 --> 24:30.700
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

413
24:30.700 --> 24:34.380
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

414
24:34.460 --> 24:37.820
♪- Be my one and only in this world; - Be my one and only in this life♪

415
24:37.900 --> 24:41.300
♪My last untouched innocence♪

416
24:41.500 --> 24:44.940
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

417
24:45.180 --> 24:48.620
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

418
24:48.740 --> 24:55.660
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

419
24:55.820 --> 24:57.700
♪- May time be free of fear; - Boats rock♪

420
24:57.700 --> 25:00.340
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn; - May time be free of pain♪

421
25:00.460 --> 25:03.020
♪You're the only one I need♪

422
25:03.060 --> 25:06.560
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

423
25:06.560 --> 25:10.220
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

424
25:10.260 --> 25:13.660
♪- Till fireworks flood the town; - Till the lake is still and clear♪

425
25:13.700 --> 25:17.140
♪The wind blows past us♪

426
25:17.420 --> 25:22.140
♪- If there's still... - Some warmth left in this world♪

427
25:22.780 --> 25:27.260
♪You're the only one I need♪

428
25:35.820 --> 25:36.580
Collator,

429
25:37.780 --> 25:39.500
how does the wine taste?

430
25:40.620 --> 25:41.780
Thank you for the drink, Your Majesty.

431
25:42.820 --> 25:43.940
It's as sweet as nectar.

432
25:48.260 --> 25:49.740
That wasn't poisoned wine.

433
25:49.940 --> 25:51.340
It was just ordinary fruit juice.

434
25:57.380 --> 25:59.500
But you drank it believing it was poisoned.

435
26:00.380 --> 26:01.980
And you drank it without hesitation.

436
26:04.660 --> 26:08.140
I'm beginning to understand Wanyao now.

437
26:12.100 --> 26:12.540
Yan Shang,

438
26:14.100 --> 26:15.860
I've seen your resolve

439
26:16.940 --> 26:18.140
and your loyalty.

440
26:20.180 --> 26:21.220
That gives me great comfort.

441
26:22.700 --> 26:24.500
But as long as I remain her wings,

442
26:25.580 --> 26:26.100
Your Majesty,

443
26:27.820 --> 26:28.860
how can you rest easy?

444
26:29.540 --> 26:31.380
So you still deserve to die.

445
26:32.460 --> 26:33.700
Just not like this.

446
26:38.740 --> 26:39.980
Then how would you have me die?

447
26:41.580 --> 26:42.300
Go to

448
26:43.220 --> 26:44.580
Lingnan Circuit on my behalf.

449
26:53.300 --> 26:54.700
I requested leave to visit my family.

450
26:55.420 --> 26:56.300
There's no need to worry, Your Highness.

451
26:59.220 --> 27:00.180
Why are your hands so cold?

452
27:00.820 --> 27:01.420
Tell me.

453
27:02.060 --> 27:02.820
What happened?

454
27:04.980 --> 27:05.460
(Yan Shang,)

455
27:05.940 --> 27:07.420
(it's precisely because of you)

456
27:07.900 --> 27:08.460
(that Wanyao)

457
27:09.700 --> 27:10.860
(is even farther)

458
27:11.380 --> 27:12.420
(from her freedom.)

459
27:18.060 --> 27:19.140
I'm just going home.

460
27:21.580 --> 27:22.940
Meng Zaishi has been placed under house arrest.

461
27:23.340 --> 27:24.020
I thought

462
27:24.420 --> 27:24.740
you...

463
27:27.060 --> 27:27.580
I'm fine.

464
27:28.140 --> 27:29.100
Then why are you going to Lingnan?

465
27:31.100 --> 27:31.780
To go home

466
27:32.220 --> 27:32.900
and see my father,

467
27:33.660 --> 27:34.740
Xiaozhou, and my elder brother.

468
27:35.660 --> 27:36.340
His Majesty has shown me kindness.

469
27:37.140 --> 27:37.860
I'm very happy.

470
27:38.340 --> 27:39.340
He's forcing you to go.

471
27:42.580 --> 27:43.700
I'm going of my own free will.

472
27:48.500 --> 27:48.900
Oh, and...

473
27:50.180 --> 27:51.460
The bamboo at my house...

474
27:52.380 --> 27:53.820
Please take good care of it for me.

475
27:54.260 --> 27:54.700
And

476
27:55.420 --> 27:57.020
please leave the swallow's nest alone.

477
27:57.580 --> 27:58.780
The swallows will return in spring.

478
27:59.060 --> 28:00.820
And you should be back by then.

479
28:05.940 --> 28:06.860
Come on. Come home with me.

480
28:07.100 --> 28:08.100
I'll help you pack.

481
28:08.300 --> 28:08.940
That won't be necessary.

482
28:13.860 --> 28:15.020
I'll have someone

483
28:15.820 --> 28:16.660
make the arrangements for him.

484
28:26.900 --> 28:28.660
I thank Your Majesty for your generosity.

485
28:29.460 --> 28:31.020
The Princess thinks highly of you.

486
28:32.340 --> 28:34.740
I'm merely showing favor to someone she cares for.

487
28:43.620 --> 28:45.060
Father, if you're so considerate of those I care for,

488
28:46.020 --> 28:46.980
why won't you let me

489
28:47.500 --> 28:49.020
take Yan Shang home to rest for a while?

490
28:49.300 --> 28:50.140
Because

491
28:51.260 --> 28:53.220
I have other plans for you.

492
28:54.660 --> 28:56.900
Starting today, you'll stay at Lizheng Hall

493
28:57.220 --> 28:59.260
and copy Buddhist scriptures to pray for your late mother.

494
29:00.940 --> 29:02.420
So I can't leave without imperial permission?

495
29:02.900 --> 29:03.380
Your Majesty,

496
29:04.260 --> 29:05.540
why must you confine the Princess?

497
29:07.780 --> 29:08.660
Wanyao,

498
29:09.500 --> 29:10.660
when your mother was alive,

499
29:10.780 --> 29:12.020
her favorite scripture

500
29:12.420 --> 29:13.740
was the Lotus Sutra.

501
29:14.100 --> 29:15.700
Copy the sutra in her memory,

502
29:16.460 --> 29:17.820
to bring peace to her soul

503
29:18.500 --> 29:20.300
and pray for her blessings and absolution.

504
29:20.740 --> 29:21.860
The Lotus Sutra has a hundred thousand characters.

505
29:22.900 --> 29:24.380
It'll take at least a hundred days to copy.

506
29:24.820 --> 29:27.260
So, Yan Shang, you may return home without worry.

507
29:27.780 --> 29:29.020
By the time you return,

508
29:29.540 --> 29:30.540
I'm sure the Princess

509
29:31.140 --> 29:31.980
will have finished copying it.

510
29:45.780 --> 29:46.540
Father, since you've given your orders,

511
29:47.980 --> 29:48.940
I dare not disobey.

512
29:52.900 --> 29:53.300
Let's go.

513
30:46.420 --> 30:47.540
It's a long journey ahead.

514
30:48.020 --> 30:49.060
I let my emotions get the better of me.

515
30:49.940 --> 30:50.860
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

516
30:57.100 --> 30:58.140
You're forgiven.

517
31:02.900 --> 31:03.260
Wanyao?

518
31:14.060 --> 31:18.900
♪Let me be the fireflies dancing across your brow♪

519
31:21.100 --> 31:26.420
♪Let me hold you whenever the rain falls♪

520
31:26.660 --> 31:30.620
♪- Together we'll soar to the skies; - Together we'll turn to ashes♪

521
31:30.620 --> 31:36.480
♪- Burning bright as a song; - Two shadows entwined, a beautiful sight♪

522
31:36.580 --> 31:41.500
♪Be the vow I whisper again and again♪

523
31:41.660 --> 31:46.380
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

524
31:46.420 --> 31:48.260
♪Not a single hour less♪

525
31:48.300 --> 31:52.220
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

526
31:52.220 --> 31:56.060
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

527
31:56.140 --> 31:59.500
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

528
31:59.660 --> 32:03.140
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

529
32:03.340 --> 32:10.220
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world, let's return to when we first met♪

530
32:10.420 --> 32:12.300
♪- May time be free of fear; - Boats rock♪

531
32:12.300 --> 32:14.940
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn; - May time be free of pain♪

532
32:14.980 --> 32:17.540
♪You're the only one I need♪ (Lizheng Hall)

533
32:17.580 --> 32:22.500
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

534
32:22.500 --> 32:24.020
Princess Danyang, please go inside.

535
32:24.780 --> 32:28.180
♪- Be my one and only in this world; - Be my one and only in this life♪

536
32:28.260 --> 32:31.660
♪My last untouched innocence♪

537
32:31.980 --> 32:35.420
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

538
32:35.660 --> 32:39.100
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

539
32:39.260 --> 32:46.140
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

540
32:46.300 --> 32:48.180
♪- May time be free of fear; - Boats rock♪

541
32:48.180 --> 32:50.820
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn; - May time be free of pain♪

542
32:50.940 --> 32:53.500
♪You're the only one I need♪

543
32:53.540 --> 32:57.160
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

544
32:57.160 --> 33:00.700
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

545
33:00.740 --> 33:04.140
♪- Till fireworks flood the town; - Till the lake is still and clear♪

546
33:04.700 --> 33:05.220
Mr. Liu,

547
33:05.700 --> 33:08.180
we've securely packed all the gifts for Mr. Yan.

548
33:19.540 --> 33:19.980
Yan Shang,

549
33:21.140 --> 33:21.980
I really envy you.

550
33:23.500 --> 33:24.340
Look how far you've come.

551
33:25.500 --> 33:26.340
You passed the imperial examinations,

552
33:27.140 --> 33:27.940
rose through the ranks,

553
33:28.740 --> 33:29.460
received imperial honors,

554
33:30.500 --> 33:31.260
and now you're returning home in glory.

555
33:32.940 --> 33:34.660
There was a time when I thought

556
33:35.300 --> 33:36.420
coming to Sheng'an

557
33:37.820 --> 33:39.060
would set me on the same path.

558
33:48.220 --> 33:48.660
(Wenji,)

559
33:50.100 --> 33:50.940
(if only you knew.)

560
33:52.340 --> 33:53.500
(These are all gifts from His Majesty)

561
33:54.460 --> 33:55.540
(to accompany me to my grave.)

562
33:59.860 --> 34:00.740
When you return to Lingnan,

563
34:01.340 --> 34:02.020
if you have time,

564
34:02.620 --> 34:03.660
please, on my behalf...

565
34:12.100 --> 34:12.980
Please, on my behalf...

566
34:17.860 --> 34:18.420
Mr. Liu,

567
34:19.020 --> 34:20.780
when will you return to the palace to report back?

568
34:26.780 --> 34:27.940
You needn't say another word.

569
34:29.060 --> 34:29.700
I understand.

570
34:43.660 --> 34:48.380
♪I gaze at high peaks and sails far away♪

571
34:48.740 --> 34:52.820
♪With the world in my heart, I leave the shore♪

572
34:53.020 --> 34:57.980
♪Dusk falls on the horizon, sorrow and joy stretch far♪

573
34:58.380 --> 35:02.220
♪A lone lamp keeps me company♪

574
35:02.900 --> 35:07.740
♪By noon, the mist will lift; rivers will bend♪

575
35:08.020 --> 35:11.580
♪I'll take the open road and journey home♪

576
35:12.540 --> 35:17.260
♪With rosy clouds, I bid the moon goodnight♪

577
35:17.900 --> 35:21.900
♪And trade my old robes for new♪

578
35:30.100 --> 35:30.940
Will these plum blossoms

579
35:32.260 --> 35:33.420
still be blooming in April?

580
35:41.420 --> 35:42.900
When I left for North Jing that year,

581
35:44.180 --> 35:45.020
the blossoms had already faded.

582
35:47.300 --> 35:47.900
Back then,

583
35:50.020 --> 35:51.820
Mother was confined to this very palace.

584
35:53.100 --> 35:54.580
Such beautiful plum blossoms...

585
35:58.260 --> 35:59.460
Mother never got to see them.

586
36:09.620 --> 36:10.860
If Chunhua were still here,

587
36:12.940 --> 36:13.580
she'd be

588
36:16.580 --> 36:18.380
fussing over me and shutting the window by now.

589
36:19.660 --> 36:20.820
You're already feeling troubled, Your Highness.

590
36:21.620 --> 36:22.820
You really shouldn't sit in the cold wind.

591
36:30.340 --> 36:31.380
Try not to dwell on it.

592
36:31.980 --> 36:34.300
The sooner you finish copying the sutra, the sooner you can leave.

593
36:34.820 --> 36:35.620
I'll prepare some ink for you.

594
36:46.820 --> 36:47.780
This palace hall...

595
36:49.820 --> 36:50.740
This imperial city...

596
36:52.700 --> 36:53.900
This entire realm of Huai...

597
36:56.100 --> 36:57.260
Where could I possibly go?

598
37:01.380 --> 37:02.740
I could bring down Yu Cheng'an,

599
37:05.100 --> 37:06.660
but I could never bring him down.

600
37:08.820 --> 37:09.420
In fact,

601
37:11.460 --> 37:13.100
I could never even bring myself to act against him.

602
37:16.940 --> 37:18.100
I'll always have to

603
37:18.860 --> 37:19.700
live under his authority,

604
37:20.460 --> 37:21.340
letting him

605
37:22.940 --> 37:24.420
decide whether we're free

606
37:25.620 --> 37:26.340
and whether we live or die.

607
37:41.420 --> 37:43.340
This was the last place Mother ever stayed.

608
37:45.660 --> 37:46.140
Cailian!

609
37:48.460 --> 37:48.860
Yes, Your Highness?

610
37:49.580 --> 37:50.220
Help me look around.

611
37:50.780 --> 37:52.660
See if anything from three years ago is still here.

612
37:53.180 --> 37:53.620
Yes, Your Highness.

613
38:04.700 --> 38:05.660
Is that Yan Shang's carriage?

614
38:10.300 --> 38:10.740
Wei Shu?

615
38:20.220 --> 38:21.260
So it seems

616
38:22.340 --> 38:23.260
you and I

617
38:24.060 --> 38:25.220
will be heading to opposite ends of the country.

618
38:26.460 --> 38:27.460
Who knows

619
38:28.260 --> 38:29.340
when we'll meet again?

620
38:31.980 --> 38:33.500
Our hometowns are thousands of miles apart,

621
38:34.740 --> 38:36.860
yet we still managed to meet in a city as vast as Sheng'an.

622
38:38.300 --> 38:39.460
As for where fate might lead us,

623
38:42.380 --> 38:43.340
who knows?

624
38:47.820 --> 38:48.460
It's just...

625
38:50.300 --> 38:51.820
I thought after everything that happened,

626
38:52.860 --> 38:54.540
His Majesty might reward your service

627
38:55.220 --> 38:56.100
by arranging a marriage

628
38:56.780 --> 38:57.700
between you and Princess Danyang.

629
39:06.340 --> 39:06.740
Wei Shu.

630
39:10.940 --> 39:11.300
Yan Shang.

631
39:29.940 --> 39:30.820
Where I'm going

632
39:31.780 --> 39:32.460
is very warm.

633
39:34.860 --> 39:35.260
Wei Shu.

634
39:44.780 --> 39:45.220
Take care.

635
40:03.580 --> 40:04.020
You too.

636
40:11.420 --> 40:12.180
Everything is here.

637
40:13.020 --> 40:15.380
I heard there used to be some books, calligraphy, and paintings

638
40:15.700 --> 40:16.460
that Her Majesty kept

639
40:16.460 --> 40:18.580
to pass the time during her months of recovery here.

640
40:19.380 --> 40:20.100
But

641
40:20.740 --> 40:22.100
after Her Majesty passed away,

642
40:22.580 --> 40:23.700
His Majesty ordered

643
40:24.180 --> 40:25.420
that they all be burned as offerings to her.

644
41:09.860 --> 41:10.300
Cailian,

645
41:11.540 --> 41:12.500
I'd like to be alone for a while.

646
41:13.380 --> 41:13.780
Yes, Your Highness.

647
41:24.820 --> 41:25.420
(Wanyao,)

648
41:27.060 --> 41:28.780
(my heart aches for you, still in the bloom of youth,)

649
41:30.060 --> 41:31.700
(yet so determined to serve your country.)

650
41:33.900 --> 41:35.060
(That a princess must shed blood and tears)

651
41:35.700 --> 41:36.820
(to safeguard the realm)

652
41:38.620 --> 41:40.500
(is a failure on the part of your father and mother.)

653
41:43.620 --> 41:44.900
(Confined within these walls,)

654
41:46.300 --> 41:47.500
(I am powerless to help you.)

655
41:49.100 --> 41:50.420
(The pain tears at my heart.)

656
41:52.980 --> 41:55.100
(As you embark upon this perilous journey,)

657
41:56.580 --> 41:58.300
(may your resolve remain as strong as iron and stone,)

658
41:59.580 --> 42:00.660
(unbroken by a hundred trials,)

659
42:02.060 --> 42:03.340
(and never be shaken.)

660
42:06.220 --> 42:07.020
(My child,)

661
42:07.980 --> 42:10.220
(now that you have left these palace walls far behind,)

662
42:11.980 --> 42:14.340
(I too must do what must be done.)

663
42:16.300 --> 42:17.820
(As long as I draw breath,)

664
42:19.620 --> 42:21.260
(I shall remain unyielding, even in the face of death,)

665
42:22.980 --> 42:24.580
(with neither regret nor remorse.)

666
42:39.420 --> 42:42.780
(Written by Your Mother)

667
43:27.020 --> 43:28.100
How much farther to Baqiao?

668
43:30.420 --> 43:32.260
You must've been lost in thought, sir.

669
43:32.860 --> 43:33.980
We passed it long ago.

670
43:34.180 --> 43:35.260
We're almost at Lantian.

671
43:40.700 --> 43:41.300
(Yan Shang,)

672
43:42.300 --> 43:43.260
(have you really thought this through?)

673
43:44.100 --> 43:45.940
(Sheng'an is no easy place to survive.)

674
43:47.140 --> 43:48.180
(Every ruthless predator)

675
43:48.380 --> 43:50.460
(in Huai is gathered there.)

676
43:51.140 --> 43:52.380
(Whatever you compete in, be it intelligence,)

677
43:52.740 --> 43:53.500
(scheming,)

678
43:53.820 --> 43:54.580
(flattery,)

679
43:55.060 --> 43:55.740
(or influence,)

680
43:56.420 --> 43:57.620
(someone will always be better than you.)

681
43:58.700 --> 43:59.660
(Every day,)

682
44:00.060 --> 44:00.900
(every moment,)

683
44:01.740 --> 44:03.140
(they fight viciously for power.)

684
44:09.340 --> 44:10.100
(And you...)

685
44:10.660 --> 44:12.180
(Don't think that just because you're clever,)

686
44:12.860 --> 44:15.420
(you'll make a name for yourself at the Imperial Academy.)

687
44:15.980 --> 44:17.420
(I grew up in Sheng'an.)

688
44:18.020 --> 44:20.940
(I've seen countless brilliant, gifted people)

689
44:21.220 --> 44:22.100
(go unrecognized)

690
44:22.540 --> 44:23.300
(and spend their lives in obscurity.)

691
44:28.220 --> 44:28.660
Yan Shang,

692
44:29.220 --> 44:30.100
if you dare repeat

693
44:31.260 --> 44:32.780
a word of what I said today to anyone else,

694
44:33.500 --> 44:35.180
I'll skin you alive!

695
44:35.660 --> 44:36.220
I promise

696
44:36.660 --> 44:37.500
I won't tell a soul.

697
44:44.580 --> 44:45.340
Forgive me, sir.

698
44:46.020 --> 44:47.380
Are you all right?

699
45:15.060 --> 45:19.820
(Next Episode Preview)

700
45:20.020 --> 45:20.940
We're like

701
45:22.100 --> 45:23.980
lambs to the slaughter.

702
45:24.540 --> 45:25.860
Going to Lingnan is a suicidal move

703
45:26.300 --> 45:27.740
for Yan Shang.

704
45:28.300 --> 45:30.780
Xun, you indeed know more than I do.

705
45:31.300 --> 45:32.180
What's really going on

706
45:32.980 --> 45:34.060
in Lingnan?

707
45:36.401 --> 45:39.694
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

708
45:42.379 --> 45:47.295
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

709
45:49.489 --> 45:55.334
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

710
45:55.834 --> 46:01.060
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

711
46:03.829 --> 46:08.620
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

712
46:09.456 --> 46:15.535
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

713
46:17.336 --> 46:20.486
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

714
46:20.486 --> 46:22.134
♪Burning bright as a song♪

715
46:22.186 --> 46:25.910
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

716
46:26.288 --> 46:30.954
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

717
46:31.573 --> 46:35.614
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

718
46:36.105 --> 46:38.220
♪Not a single hour less♪

719
46:38.260 --> 46:45.206
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

720
46:45.969 --> 46:49.422
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

721
46:49.602 --> 46:52.747
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

722
46:53.186 --> 46:59.823
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

723
47:00.220 --> 47:02.258
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

724
47:02.258 --> 47:04.734
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

725
47:04.772 --> 47:07.241
♪You're the only one I need♪

726
47:07.445 --> 47:14.332
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

727
47:14.644 --> 47:17.915
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

728
47:18.220 --> 47:21.393
♪My last untouched innocence♪

729
47:21.717 --> 47:25.143
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

730
47:25.376 --> 47:28.601
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

731
47:28.932 --> 47:35.728
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

732
47:36.097 --> 47:38.159
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

733
47:38.160 --> 47:40.663
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

734
47:40.710 --> 47:43.048
♪You're the only one I need♪

735
47:43.279 --> 47:50.114
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

736
47:50.463 --> 47:52.081
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

737
47:52.211 --> 47:54.007
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

738
47:54.364 --> 47:57.381
♪You're the only one I need♪

739
47:57.421 --> 47:58.748
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)
